    "ImporterSection": {
      "description": "What an imported Run was imported from (ADR-0013 §5, phase-6 decision 36): the\nEvidence store, the Fidelity it supports, the query that read it, when, and every fact\nthe evidence lacked, as the Trace's `import/source` Event names them.",
